B.aoP=new A.e("Components.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.amq=new A.e(" Components describe the complete inventory of first-party and third-party components. The specification can represent software, hardware devices, machine learning models, source code, and configurations, along with the manufacturer information, license and copyright details, and complete pedigree and provenance for every component.",!1,!1,!1,null)
