B.amp=new A.e("Services.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.anh=new A.e(" Services represent external APIs that the software may call. They describe endpoint URIs, authentication requirements, and trust boundary traversals. The data flow between software and services can also be described, including the data classifications and the flow direction of each type.",!1,!1,!1,null)
