B.aq3=new A.e("Vulnerabilities.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aqq=new A.e(" Known vulnerabilities inherited from the use of third-party and open-source software and the exploitability of the vulnerabilities can be communicated with CycloneDX. Previously unknown vulnerabilities affecting both components and services may also be disclosed using CycloneDX, making it ideal for both vulnerability disclosure and VEX use cases.",!1,!1,!1,null)
