B.ajD=new A.e("Definitions.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aoy=new A.e(" Standards, requirements, levels, and all supporting documentation are defined here. CycloneDX provides a general-purpose, machine-readable way to define virtually any type of standard. Security standards such as OWASP ASVS, MASVS, SCVS, and SAMM are available in CycloneDX format. Standards from other bodies are available as well. Additionally, organizations can create internal standards and represent them in CycloneDX.",!1,!1,!1,null)
