B.ams=new A.e("6.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.amE=new A.e(" Customer authorizes Company to appoint sub-processors in accordance with the provision of the Terms. Any subcontractor used must qualify as a service provider under the Applicable Data Protection Laws. Company cannot make any disclosures to the subcontractor that the CCPA would treat as a sale.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a0c=s([B.ams,B.amE],t.c)
B.apa=new A.e("6.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.alz=new A.e(" Company may continue to use those sub-processors already engaged by Company as of the date of this DPA. Customer acknowledges and agrees that as of the date of this DPA Company uses certain sub-processors; a list of such sub-processors will be provided upon request.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a0y=s([B.apa,B.alz],t.c)
B.ame=new A.e("6.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ao4=new A.e(" Company may appoint new sub-processors and shall give reasonable notice of the appointment of any new sub-processor. Customer\u2019s continued use of the applicable services after such notification constitutes Customer\u2019s acceptance of the new sub-processor.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a_2=s([B.ame,B.ao4],t.c)
B.a6X=s([B.a0c,B.a0y,B.a_2],t.a)
B.Ik=new A.d7(B.a6X)
B.RK=new A.b0(2,"\xa7 7. Data Subjects\u2019 Rights")
B.ald=new A.e("7.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aql=new A.e(" Customer shall be solely responsible for compliance with any statutory obligations concerning requests to exercise data subject rights under Applicable Data Protection Laws (e.g., for access, rectification, deletion of processed Customer Data, etc.). Company shall reasonably endeavor to assist Customer insofar as feasible, to fulfil Customer\u2019s said obligations with respect to such data subject requests, as applicable, at Customer\u2019s sole reasonable expense.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.Tv=s([B.ald,B.aql],t.c)
B.aoK=new A.e("7.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.akM=new A.e(" Company shall (i) without undue delay notify customer if it receives a request from a data subject under any Applicable Data Protection Laws in respect of Processed Personal Data; and (ii) not respond to that request, except on the written instructions of Customer or as required by Applicable Data Protection Laws, in which case Company shall, to the extent permitted by Applicable Data Protection Laws, inform controller/business of that legal requirement before it responds to the request.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.Za=s([B.aoK,B.akM],t.c)
B.a_U=s([B.Tv,B.Za],t.a)
B.Iv=new A.d7(B.a_U)
B.RR=new A.b0(2,"\xa7 8. Personal Data Breach")
B.aos=new A.e("8.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.apB=new A.e(" Company shall notify Customer without undue delay upon Company becoming aware of any personal data breach within the meaning of Applicable Data Protection Laws relating to Customer Data which may require a notification to be made to a supervisory authority or data subject under Applicable Data Protection Laws (\u201cPersonal Data Breach\u201c).",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.XE=s([B.aos,B.apB],t.c)
B.aq2=new A.e("8.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ant=new A.e(" At the written request of the Customer and at Customer\u2019s sole expense, Company shall provide reasonable co-operation and assistance to Customer in respect of Customer\u2019s obligations regarding the investigation of any Personal Data Breach and the notification to the supervisory authority and data subjects in respect of such a Personal Data Breach; provided, however, that Company shall, at its own expense, use reasonable efforts to contain and remedy any Personal Data Breach caused by Company (or its agents, representatives, or subcontractors) without undue delay and prevent any further Personal Data Breach, including, but not limited to taking any and all reasonable action necessary to comply with Applicable Data Protection Laws.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a7B=s([B.aq2,B.ant],t.c)
B.Wx=s([B.XE,B.a7B],t.a)
B.Iz=new A.d7(B.Wx)
B.RE=new A.b0(2,"\xa7 9. Deletion or Return of Processed Personal Data")
B.amr=new A.e("9.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.apG=new A.e(" Subject to the terms hereof, Company shall within up to sixty (60) days, unless a sooner time period is required by Applicable Data Protection Laws, return and then destroy the Customer Data, except such copies as authorized including under this DPA or required to be retained in accordance with Applicable Data Protection Laws.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.Yk=s([B.amr,B.apG],t.c)
B.ao1=new A.e("9.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.app=new A.e(" Company may retain Customer Data only to the extent authorized or required by Applicable Data Protection Laws, provided that Company shall ensure the confidentiality of such Customer Data and shall ensure that it is only processed for such legal purpose(s). The provisions of this DPA shall govern any such retained Customer Data.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.Uc=s([B.ao1,B.app],t.c)
B.alb=new A.e("9.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.aoh=new A.e(" Upon Customer\u2019s prior written request, Company shall provide written certification to Customer that it has complied with this Section 9.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.Ww=s([B.alb,B.aoh],t.c)
B.a0a=s([B.Yk,B.Uc,B.Ww],t.a)
B.Iw=new A.d7(B.a0a)
B.RJ=new A.b0(2,"\xa7 10. Audit Rights")
B.amz=new A.e("10.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.amA=new A.e(" Subject to the terms hereof, and not more than once in each calendar year, Company shall make available to a reputable auditor mandated by Customer in coordination with Company, at the reasonable cost of the Customer upon prior written request, within normal business hours at Company premises, such information necessary and relevant to reasonably demonstrate compliance with this DPA, and shall allow for audits by such reputable auditor mandated by the Customer in relation to the processing of the Customer Data by Company, provided that such third-party auditor shall be subject to confidentiality obligations.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.a3s=s([B.amz,B.amA],t.c)
B.amY=new A.e("10.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.anw=new A.e(" Customer shall use (and ensure that each of its mandated auditors use) its best efforts to avoid causing (or, if it cannot avoid, to minimize) any damage, injury or disruption to Company\u2019s premises, equipment, personnel and business while its personnel are on those premises in the course of such an audit or inspection.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.YK=s([B.amY,B.anw],t.c)
B.a0q=s([B.a3s,B.YK],t.a)
B.It=new A.d7(B.a0q)
B.So=new A.b0(2,"\xa7 11. International Data Transfers")
B.aiP=new A.e("11.1.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ajw=new A.e(" Customer may select the datacenters locations as offered by Company where Customer Data will be processed. Once Customer has made its choice, Company will not transfer Customer Data from Customer\u2019s selected locations, except as necessary to provide the Services initiated by Customer, or as specifically required by the Customer, or as necessary to comply with applicable law.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.Vv=s([B.aiP,B.ajw],t.c)
B.aiO=new A.e("11.2.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.anR=new A.e(" Subject to Section 11.1, Personal Data may be transferred from the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom (\u201cUK\u201d) to countries that offer an adequate level of data protection under or pursuant to the adequacy decisions, as determined by the European Commission pursuant to Article 45 of GDPR, and by the Secretary of State, pursuant to Section 17A of the United Kingdom Data Protection Act 2018, respectively, or other adequate authority, as determined by the EU (\u201cAdequacy Decisions\u201d), as applicable, without any further safeguard being necessary.",!1,!1,!1,null)
B.Zw=s([B.aiO,B.anR],t.c)
B.aoH=new A.e("11.3.",!0,!1,!1,null)
B.ao8=new A.e(" To the extent that Company transfers (either directly or via onward transfer) Personal Data to countries outside of the European Economic Area and/or outside of the UK, which have not been subject to a relevant Adequacy Decision, or such transfers are not performed through an alternative recognized compliance mechanism as may be adopted by Company for the lawful transfer of Personal Data (as set out under the GDPR), and to the extent applicable with respect to each data subject, such transfer of Customer\u2019s Personal Data to other countries, shall be subject, where the application of such SCCs, as between the parties, is required under Applicable Data Protection Laws, to the Standard Contractual Clauses, as such are incorporated into this DPA by reference, and shall be implemented as follows:",!1,!1,!1,null)
